4175570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99179#issuecomment-2474175570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99179","id":2474175570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TeOxS","user":{"login":"yankscally","id":27631913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjMxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27631913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally","html_url":"https://github.com/yankscally","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-13T16:48:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T16:50:56Z","body":"> You haven't applied the feature, you're just creating one, not using it, see [`EditorInterface.set_current_editor_profile`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_editorinterface.html#class-editorinterface-method-set-current-feature-profile)\r\n\r\nRight, I see now.\r\n\r\n\r\nI was just attempting something like this until I read your edit, and then I see what you mean. I was actually doing this as a hack to refresh the assetlib. when you add a new URL to it, it doesn't update in this dropdown, even when reloading\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1570857a-b450-4f8b-a560-4d91b49f5c9c)\r\n\r\n```swift\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorPlugin\r\n\r\nvar icosa_endpoint = {\"icosa-gallery.com\" : \"https://icosa-gallery.com/api/v1/assets\"}\r\n\r\nfunc add_endpoint():\r\n\tvar settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\r\n\tvar urls = settings.get_setting(\"asset_library/available_urls\")\r\n\tif not (icosa_endpoint.keys()[0] in urls):\r\n\t\turls[icosa_endpoint.keys()[0]] = icosa_endpoint.values()[0]\r\n\t\tsettings.set_setting(\"asset_library/available_urls\", urls)\r\n\r\nfunc remove_endpoint():\r\n\tvar settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\r\n\tvar urls = settings.get_setting(\"asset_library/available_urls\")\r\n\tif icosa_endpoint.keys()[0] in urls:\r\n\t\turls.erase(icosa_endpoint.keys()[0])\r\n\t\tsettings.set_setting(\"asset_library/available_urls\", urls)\r\n```\r\n\r\nif I add it manually it works, when I do it from code I only see this:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b210a9db-2eca-4d2a-8caa-c1b6c9b8ebf2)\r\n\r\n\r\nTo make this issue worthwhile, I will change the name to \"no way to programmatically add Asset Library URL\".\r\n\r\nIt's not worth trying to re-use current the asset library. I will just make a new interface.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2474175570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2474188143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99179#issuecomment-2474188143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99179","id":2474188143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TeR1v","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShi